# @tag:in-development
"""
## Purpose and audience
This manual-first acceptance specification guides operators through the exact
Windows bootstrap promotion, integrated tool verification, publication, and
local deployment/rollback workflow. It remains deliberately RED until each
helper is wired to retained production evidence.

## Operator workflow
Run this specification only with an admitted full Simple CLI. It validates
immutable receipts and invokes interpreter-mode subprocess checks where required.

## Compatibility and limitations
The Rust seed, raw source, mutable deployed wrappers, cross-host artifacts, and
fabricated blocked-row passes are unsupported evidence.

## Verification guidance and troubleshooting
Every failed helper names the missing production evidence. Do not replace a
failure with a placeholder PASS; retain the exact command, digest, log, owner,
and resume condition.
"""
